 result←object value arg;pgs;was;tab

 pgs←object pages ⍬ ⍝ And what are our Page names (in order)?
 :If was←×≢tab←object ##.##.∆WG'TabObj'
     was←(1+≢pgs)|pgs⍳⊂##.##.LeafName⍕tab ##.##.∆WG'TabObj' ⍝ Get the index number of the Page currently selected
 :EndIf
 :If 0=≢arg
     result←was ⍝ Just return the current Page index number
 :Else
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: value'##.##.Error(1≠≢arg)∨~##.##.IsInt arg ⍝ It better be only a single scalar
     'Cannot de-select a current page in Dyalog'##.##.Error 0∊arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: value'##.##.Error~arg⊃⍛∊⍳≢pgs ⍝ And one of the valid page numbers
     tab←(object ⎕VGET arg⊃pgs)##.##.∆WG'TabObj' ⍝ Which Page tab-object did they ask to select?
     1 ##.##.∆NQ tab'Select' ¯2 ⍝ "Press" the new tab-button (which should fire the onValidate events) & tell 'em where it came from
     result←##.NoRes
 :EndIf
